{"path":"ranges/slide_view/begin","title":"std::ranges::slide_view<V>::begin","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::slide_view&lt;V&gt;::</span>begin","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/slide_view/begin","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Returns an iterator to the first element of the slide_view.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_1\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*simple-view*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*slide-caches-nothing*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*slide-caches-nothing*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> V<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns an iterator to the first element of the <code>slide_view</code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> If <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">V</span> models <code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/slide_view#slide-caches-first\">slide-caches-first</a></i></code>, equivalent to:\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> iterator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span>,<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ranges/next\"><span class=\"kw3161\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">next</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, n_ <span class=\"sy2\">-</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"><span class=\"kw2902\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">end</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>,<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;n_<br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>\n</p>\nOtherwise, equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> iterator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, n_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> If <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">V</span> models <code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/slide_view#slide-caches-first\">slide-caches-first</a></i></code> this function caches the result within the <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/slide_view#Data_members\"><code><i>cached_begin_</i></code></a> for use on subsequent calls. This is necessary to provide the amortized constant-time complexity required by the <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/range\"><code>range</code></a>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> iterator<span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/begin\"><span class=\"kw2900\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">begin</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>base_<span class=\"br0\">)</span>, n_<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>An <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/slide_view/iterator\">iterator</a> to the first element of <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/slide_view\"><code>slide_view</code></a>, which points to the <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/slide_view#Data_members\"><code><i>n_</i></code></a>-sized subrange of the possibly const-qualified underlying view type – <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">V</span> for overload <span class=\"t-v\">(<a href=\"#Version_1\">1</a>)</span> or <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> V</span> for overload <span class=\"t-v\">(<a href=\"#Version_2\">2</a>)</span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string_view&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">using</span> <span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">literals</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">static</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> source <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"st0\">\"∀x\"</span>sv, <span class=\"st0\">\"∃y\"</span>sv, <span class=\"st0\">\"ε\"</span>sv, <span class=\"st0\">\"δ\"</span>sv<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> view<span class=\"br0\">{</span>std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/slide_view\"><span class=\"kw3705\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">slide_view</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>source, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> subrange<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>view.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1256\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string_view</span></span></a> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> s <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> subrange<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>∀x ∃y</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/slide_view/end\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>end</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns an iterator or a sentinel to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/slide_view/sentinel/operator_cmp\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator==</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(C++23)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>   compares a sentinel with an iterator returned from <strong class=\"selflink\"><code>slide_view::begin</code></strong>  <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/slide_view","title":"std::ranges::views::slide, std::ranges::slide_view"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::slide_view<V>::begin","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++23. Returns an iterator to the first element of the slide_view."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"An iterator to the first element of slide_view, which points to the n_-sized subrange of the possibly const-qualified underlying view type – V for overload…"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"end","no